{
  "Npcs.AkbalFierce.Desc": "Tensed and poised, the tan black-spotted jaguar seems a hair-trigger away from a ferocious strike at any moment. His emerald eyes burn with determination and zeal. This beast is not going to take it easy; this is not just another day fruitlessly fighting off the many critters that wander clueless into his domain, this is his mission. He doesn't need to say a word with his telepathy to make this clear."
  "Npcs.AkbalFierce.Name": "Akbal"
}
